{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021124712300-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021130852\"/><p>和樂邨居安樓有人上吊亡。</p><p>觀塘有人上吊亡。今午(21日)12時15分，一名男子在和樂邨居安樓一單位內上吊，家人發現報案求助。救護車接報到場將昏迷事主送院搶救，惜最終證實不治，人員正了解其輕生原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T05:20:05.611761+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:47:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T05:57:45.407554+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T05:17:40.064838+00:00","content_hash":"875a8de57bff4dac36a002a17e6682622180a158ca31818836a6f2426f5b95a2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}